{'symbol': 'ILMN', 'date': '2023-04-20 08:30:00', 'title': "ILLUMINA URGES SHAREHOLDERS TO VOTE THE WHITE PROXY CARD FOR ALL NINE OF ILLUMINA'S NOMINEES", 'text': "SAN DIEGO , APRIL 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ILLUMINA, INC. (NASDAQ: ILMN), A GLOBAL LEADER IN DNA SEQUENCING AND ARRAY-BASED TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY URGED SHAREHOLDERS TO VOTE IN FAVOR OF ILLUMINA'S SLATE OF HIGHLY QUALIFIED DIRECTOR NOMINEES. IT ALSO ANNOUNCED THAT ITS ANNUAL MEETING WILL BE HELD VIRTUALLY ON MAY 25, 2023, AT 10:00 AM PACIFIC TIME (1:00 PM EASTERN TIME)."}